WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.049
A familiar request can hide a boundary decision.

2
00:00:03.049 --> 00:00:05.336
Daniel first identifies the legitimate need.

3
00:00:05.336 --> 00:00:08.766
He checks the particular action against the current mandate.

4
00:00:08.766 --> 00:00:14.864
When the method is not authorised, he offers a useful alternative and reaches the proper owner.

5
00:00:14.864 --> 00:00:18.676
The record shows what actually happened, including what remains unknown.

6
00:00:18.676 --> 00:00:21.725
You will practise that method in this unit.

